OL,3,GNEWSADeath threats reported in red
OL,4,Aroute row
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople have received death threats in a
OL,7,Frow over new traffic restrictions,
OL,8,Faccording to a Luton councillor.
OL,10,FLuton Borough Council is planning an
OL,11,F18-month trial of a red route in Bury
OL,12,FPark, which would involve a ban on
OL,13,Fstreet parking and loading.
OL,15,FLabour's Alia Khan told Thursday's full
OL,16,Fcouncil meeting that there had been
OL,17,F"death threats" and an "abhorrent
OL,18,Fsocial media campaign" against the
OL,19,Fmove, which left some feeling "unsafe".
